                <pb facs="0250" n="150" xml:id="pg150"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.00/23925: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Mexico</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Summerlin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-05-09T14:00:00-06:36"><hi rendition="#italic">May 9, 1920—2
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received May 10—9:45 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>192. General Obregón entered the city at noon today with several thousand troops.
                    The city continues to be quiet.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Summerlin</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
